OL,3,GNEWSANew police boss says activists
OL,4,Awon't dictate plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new boss of West Midlands Police
OL,7,Fhas been appointed, after saying he
OL,8,Fwould not be guided by politics,
OL,9,Freligion or activists.
OL,11,FScott Green had been serving as acting
OL,12,Fchief constable since January after the
OL,13,Fformer Chief Constable Craig Guildford
OL,14,Fleft amid controversy over Israeli
OL,15,Ffootball fans being banned from
OL,16,Fattending a match in Birmingham.
OL,18,FGreen had already been named as the
OL,19,Fpreferred candidate by the West
OL,20,FMidlands Police and Crime Commissioner
OL,21,F(PCC).
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
