OL,3,GNEWSANew police boss says activists
OL,4,Awon't dictate plans
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My decisions will be based on law,
OL,7,Fevidence, professional policing
OL,8,Fstandards, threat harm and risk, not
OL,9,Fpolitical, religious, social, activism
OL,10,Fdriven or unconscious bias pressures,"
OL,11,Fhe said.
